@context: CALL HOST — hand a step to your own code, and get a value back.
@title: call_your_code

# Needs a hook script that registers the handlers:
#   manul 12_call_your_code.hunt --hooks hooks/manul_hooks.py
# {site} and {run_id} are not declared here: before_all in the hook publishes them.

STEP 1: Ask your code for test data
    CALL HOST qs.new_user into {user}
    PRINT "run {run_id} uses {user}"

STEP 2: Check the page against your own arithmetic
    NAVIGATE to {site}/shop.html
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Manul Plush'
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Snow Boots'
    EXTRACT the 'Cart total' into {ui_total}
    CALL HOST qs.sum "24.50" "89.99" into {expected}
    VERIFY 'Cart total' field has value '{expected}'

DONE.
